{"unit_id":"d3cker__dsh-web-search-searxng#feature-1","repo":"d3cker/dsh-web-search-searxng","commit":"cbf7071c362de71ff12bc3c5295392384f1d517f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-searxng 的功能「提交关键词」：用户通过 DSH 的网页搜索发起查询；provider 向配置的 SearXNG `/search` 接口发送 GET 请求，并附带 query 与 JSON 格式参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/provider.js:87-121"]}
